<p id=mwBRE>There are currently <span about=#mwt603 typeof=mw:Transclusion id=mwBRI data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"NUMBEROF","href":"./Template:NUMBEROF"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"active"},"2":{"wt":"Wikipedia"}},"i":0}}]}'>348</span> language editions of Wikipedia (also called <i id=mwBRM>language versions</i>, or simply <i id=mwBRQ>Wikipedias</i>). As of <span about=#mwt604 typeof=mw:Transclusion id=mwBRU data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"CURRENTMONTHNAME","function":"currentmonthname"},"params":{},"i":0}}]}'>October</span> <span about=#mwt605 typeof=mw:Transclusion id=mwBRY data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"CURRENTYEAR","function":"currentyear"},"params":{},"i":0}}]}'>2026</span>, the six largest, in order of article count, are the <a rel=mw:WikiLink href=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/English_Wikipedia title="English Wikipedia" about=#mwt606 typeof=mw:Transclusion id=mwBRc data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Wikipedia rank by size/WP","href":"./Template:Wikipedia_rank_by_size/WP"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"1"}},"i":0}}]}'>English</a>, <a rel=mw:WikiLink href=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cebuano_Wikipedia title="Cebuano Wikipedia" about=#mwt607 typeof=mw:Transclusion id=mwBRg data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Wikipedia rank by size/WP","href":"./Template:Wikipedia_rank_by_size/WP"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"2"}},"i":0}}]}'>Cebuano</a>, <a rel=mw:WikiLink href=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/German_Wikipedia title="German Wikipedia" about=#mwt608 typeof=mw:Transclusion id=mwBRk data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Wikipedia rank by size/WP","href":"./Template:Wikipedia_rank_by_size/WP"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"3"}},"i":0}}]}'>German</a>, <a rel=mw:WikiLink href=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/French_Wikipedia title="French Wikipedia" about=#mwt609 typeof=mw:Transclusion id=mwBRo data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Wikipedia rank by size/WP","href":"./Template:Wikipedia_rank_by_size/WP"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"4"}},"i":0}}]}'>French</a>, <a rel=mw:WikiLink href=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Swedish_Wikipedia title="Swedish Wikipedia" about=#mwt610 typeof=mw:Transclusion id=mwBRs data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Wikipedia rank by size/WP","href":"./Template:Wikipedia_rank_by_size/WP"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"5"}},"i":0}}]}'>Swedish</a>, and <a rel=mw:WikiLink href=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dutch_Wikipedia title="Dutch Wikipedia" about=#mwt611 typeof=mw:Transclusion id=mwBRw data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Wikipedia rank by size/WP","href":"./Template:Wikipedia_rank_by_size/WP"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"6"}},"i":0}}]}'>Dutch</a> Wikipedias.<sup about=#mwt617 class="mw-ref reference" id=cite_ref-WP_list_of_WPs_by_article_1_190-0 rel=dc:references typeof=mw:Extension/ref data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"WP list of WPs by article 1"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-WP_list_of_WPs_by_article_1-190"}}'><a href=#cite_note-WP_list_of_WPs_by_article_1-190 id=mwBR0><span class=mw-reflink-text id=mwBR4><span class=cite-bracket id=mwBR8>[</span>181<span class=cite-bracket id=mwBSA>]</span></span></a></sup> The <span about=#mwt612 typeof=mw:Transclusion id=mwBSE data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"ordinal to word","href":"./Template:Ordinal_to_word"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"{{Wikipedia rank by size|ceb}}"}},"i":0}}]}'>second</span> and <span about=#mwt613 typeof=mw:Transclusion id=mwBSI data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"ordinal to word","href":"./Template:Ordinal_to_word"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"{{Wikipedia rank by size|sv}}"}},"i":0}}]}'>fifth</span>-largest Wikipedias owe their position to the article-creating bot <a rel=mw:WikiLink href=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lsjbot title=Lsjbot id=mwBSM>Lsjbot</a>, which <span about=#mwt614 typeof=mw:Transclusion id=mwBSQ data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"as of","href":"./Template:As_of"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"2013"},"lc":{"wt":"y"}},"i":0}}]}'>as of 2013</span><sup class="plainlinks noexcerpt noprint asof-tag update" style=display:none about=#mwt614></sup><span typeof=mw:Nowiki about=#mwt614></span><link rel=mw:PageProp/Category href=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Category:Articles_containing_potentially_dated_statements_from_2013 about=#mwt614><link rel=mw:PageProp/Category href=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Category:All_articles_containing_potentially_dated_statements about=#mwt614 id=mwBSU> had created about half the articles on the <a rel=mw:WikiLink href=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Swedish_Wikipedia title="Swedish Wikipedia" id=mwBSY>Swedish Wikipedia</a>, and most of the articles in the <a rel=mw:WikiLink href=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cebuano_Wikipedia title="Cebuano Wikipedia" id=mwBSc>Cebuano</a> and <a rel=mw:WikiLink href=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Waray_Wikipedia title="Waray Wikipedia" id=mwBSg>Waray Wikipedias</a>. The latter are both languages of the <a rel=mw:WikiLink href=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Philippines title=Philippines id=mwBSk>Philippines</a>.</p>
<p id=mwBSo>In addition to the top six, twelve other Wikipedias have more than a million articles each (<a rel=mw:WikiLink href=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spanish_Wikipedia title="Spanish Wikipedia" about=#mwt618 typeof=mw:Transclusion id=mwBSs data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Wikipedia rank by size/WP","href":"./Template:Wikipedia_rank_by_size/WP"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"7"}},"i":0}}]}'>Spanish</a>, <a rel=mw:WikiLink href=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Russian_Wikipedia title="Russian Wikipedia" about=#mwt619 typeof=mw:Transclusion id=mwBSw data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Wikipedia rank by size/WP","href":"./Template:Wikipedia_rank_by_size/WP"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"8"}},"i":0}}]}'>Russian</a>, <a rel=mw:WikiLink href=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Italian_Wikipedia title="Italian Wikipedia" about=#mwt620 typeof=mw:Transclusion id=mwBS0 data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Wikipedia rank by size/WP","href":"./Template:Wikipedia_rank_by_size/WP"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"9"}},"i":0}}]}'>Italian</a>, <a rel=mw:WikiLink href=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Polish_Wikipedia title="Polish Wikipedia" about=#mwt621 typeof=mw:Transclusion id=mwBS4 data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Wikipedia rank by size/WP","href":"./Template:Wikipedia_rank_by_size/WP"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"10"}},"i":0}}]}'>Polish</a>, <a rel=mw:WikiLink href=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Egyptian_Arabic_Wikipedia title="Egyptian Arabic Wikipedia" about=#mwt622 typeof=mw:Transclusion id=mwBS8 data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Wikipedia rank by size/WP","href":"./Template:Wikipedia_rank_by_size/WP"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"11"}},"i":0}}]}'>Egyptian Arabic</a>, <a rel=mw:WikiLink href=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chinese_Wikipedia title="Chinese Wikipedia" about=#mwt623 typeof=mw:Transclusion id=mwBTA data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Wikipedia rank by size/WP","href":"./Template:Wikipedia_rank_by_size/WP"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"12"}},"i":0}}]}'>Chinese</a>, <a rel=mw:WikiLink href=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Japanese_Wikipedia title="Japanese Wikipedia" about=#mwt624 typeof=mw:Transclusion id=mwBTE data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Wikipedia rank by size/WP","href":"./Template:Wikipedia_rank_by_size/WP"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"13"}},"i":0}}]}'>Japanese</a>, <a rel=mw:WikiLink href=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ukrainian_Wikipedia title="Ukrainian Wikipedia" about=#mwt625 typeof=mw:Transclusion id=mwBTI data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Wikipedia rank by size/WP","href":"./Template:Wikipedia_rank_by_size/WP"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"14"}},"i":0}}]}'>Ukrainian</a>, <a rel=mw:WikiLink href=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Arabic_Wikipedia title="Arabic Wikipedia" about=#mwt626 typeof=mw:Transclusion id=mwBTM data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Wikipedia rank by size/WP","href":"./Template:Wikipedia_rank_by_size/WP"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"15"}},"i":0}}]}'>Arabic</a>, <a rel=mw:WikiLink href=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vietnamese_Wikipedia title="Vietnamese Wikipedia" about=#mwt627 typeof=mw:Transclusion id=mwBTQ data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Wikipedia rank by size/WP","href":"./Template:Wikipedia_rank_by_size/WP"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"16"}},"i":0}}]}'>Vietnamese</a>, <a rel=mw:WikiLink href=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Waray_Wikipedia title="Waray Wikipedia" about=#mwt628 typeof=mw:Transclusion id=mwBTU data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Wikipedia rank by size/WP","href":"./Template:Wikipedia_rank_by_size/WP"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"17"}},"i":0}}]}'>Waray</a>, and <a rel=mw:WikiLink href=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Portuguese_Wikipedia title="Portuguese Wikipedia" about=#mwt629 typeof=mw:Transclusion id=mwBTY data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Wikipedia rank by size/WP","href":"./Template:Wikipedia_rank_by_size/WP"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"18"}},"i":0}}]}'>Portuguese</a>), seven more have over 500,000 articles (<a rel=mw:WikiLink href=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Persian_Wikipedia title="Persian Wikipedia" about=#mwt630 typeof=mw:Transclusion id=mwBTc data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Wikipedia rank by size/WP","href":"./Template:Wikipedia_rank_by_size/WP"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"19"}},"i":0}}]}'>Persian</a>, <a rel=mw:WikiLink href=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chechen_Wikipedia title="Chechen Wikipedia" about=#mwt631 typeof=mw:Transclusion class=mw-redirect id=mwBTg data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Wikipedia rank by size/WP","href":"./Template:Wikipedia_rank_by_size/WP"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"20"}},"i":0}}]}'>Chechen</a>, <a rel=mw:WikiLink href=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Catalan_Wikipedia title="Catalan Wikipedia" about=#mwt632 typeof=mw:Transclusion id=mwBTk data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Wikipedia rank by size/WP","href":"./Template:Wikipedia_rank_by_size/WP"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"21"}},"i":0}}]}'>Catalan</a>, <a rel=mw:WikiLink href=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Indonesian_Wikipedia title="Indonesian Wikipedia" about=#mwt633 typeof=mw:Transclusion id=mwBTo data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Wikipedia rank by size/WP","href":"./Template:Wikipedia_rank_by_size/WP"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"22"}},"i":0}}]}'>Indonesian</a>, <a rel=mw:WikiLink href=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Korean_Wikipedia title="Korean Wikipedia" about=#mwt634 typeof=mw:Transclusion id=mwBTs data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Wikipedia rank by size/WP","href":"./Template:Wikipedia_rank_by_size/WP"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"23"}},"i":0}}]}'>Korean</a>, <a rel=mw:WikiLink href=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Serbian_Wikipedia title="Serbian Wikipedia" about=#mwt635 typeof=mw:Transclusion id=mwBTw data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Wikipedia rank by size/WP","href":"./Template:Wikipedia_rank_by_size/WP"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"24"}},"i":0}}]}'>Serbian</a>, and <a rel=mw:WikiLink href=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tatar_Wikipedia title="Tatar Wikipedia" about=#mwt636 typeof=mw:Transclusion id=mwBT0 data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Wikipedia rank by size/WP","href":"./Template:Wikipedia_rank_by_size/WP"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"25"}},"i":0}}]}'>Tatar</a>), 44 more have over 100,000, and 82 more have over 10,000.<sup about=#mwt645 class="mw-ref reference" id=cite_ref-ListOfWikipedias_191-0 rel=dc:references typeof=mw:Extension/ref data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"ListOfWikipedias"}}'><a href=#cite_note-ListOfWikipedias-191 id=mwBT4><span class=mw-reflink-text id=mwBT8><span class=cite-bracket id=mwBUA>[</span>182<span class=cite-bracket id=mwBUE>]</span></span></a></sup><sup about=#mwt646 class="mw-ref reference" id=cite_ref-WP_list_of_WPs_by_article_1_190-1 rel=dc:references typeof=mw:Extension/ref data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"WP list of WPs by article 1"}}'><a href=#cite_note-WP_list_of_WPs_by_article_1-190 id=mwBUI><span class=mw-reflink-text id=mwBUM><span class=cite-bracket id=mwBUQ>[</span>181<span class=cite-bracket id=mwBUU>]</span></span></a></sup> The largest, the English Wikipedia, has over <span about=#mwt637 typeof=mw:Transclusion id=mwBUY data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"#expr: 0.1*floor({{NUMBEROFARTICLES:R}}/100000)","function":"expr"},"params":{},"i":0}}]}'>7.2</span><span typeof=mw:Entity id=mwBUc>&nbsp;</span>million articles. <span about=#mwt638 typeof=mw:Transclusion id=mwBUg data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"As of","href":"./Template:As_of"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"2021"},"2":{"wt":"01"},"post":{"wt":","}},"i":0}}]}'>As of January</span><span typeof=mw:Entity about=#mwt638>&nbsp;</span><span about=#mwt638>2021</span><span typeof=mw:Nowiki about=#mwt638></span><span about=#mwt638>,</span><sup class="plainlinks noexcerpt noprint asof-tag update" style=display:none about=#mwt638></sup><span typeof=mw:Nowiki about=#mwt638></span><link rel=mw:PageProp/Category href=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Category:Articles_containing_potentially_dated_statements_from_January_2021 about=#mwt638><link rel=mw:PageProp/Category href=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Category:All_articles_containing_potentially_dated_statements about=#mwt638 id=mwBUk> the English Wikipedia receives 48% of Wikipedia's cumulative traffic, with the remaining split among the other languages. The top 10 editions represent approximately 85% of the total traffic.<sup about=#mwt649 class="mw-ref reference" id=cite_ref-192 rel=dc:references typeof=mw:Extension/ref data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-192"}}'><a href=#cite_note-192 id=mwBUo><span class=mw-reflink-text id=mwBUs><span class=cite-bracket id=mwBUw>[</span>183<span class=cite-bracket id=mwBU0>]</span></span></a></sup><ul class="gallery mw-gallery-packed" typeof=mw:Extension/gallery about=#mwt650 id=mwBU4 data-mw='{"name":"gallery","attrs":{"mode":"packed","heights":"200"},"body":{}}'>
