<span class="mw-empty-elt sf-hidden" about=#mwt1619 typeof=mw:Transclusion id=mwDfU data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Notelist","href":"./Template:Notelist"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"30em"}},"i":0}}]}'><style data-mw-deduplicate=TemplateStyles:r1327269900 typeof=mw:Extension/templatestyles about=#mwt1620 data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Reflist/styles.css"}}'>.mw-parser-output .references[data-mw-group=lower-alpha]{list-style-type:lower-alpha}</style></span><div class="mw-references-wrap mw-references-columns" style=column-width:calc(0.9*30em) about=#mwt1619 id=mwDfY><ol class="mw-references references" data-mw-group=lower-alpha typeof=mw:Extension/references about=#mwt1621 id=mwDfc data-mw='{"name":"references","attrs":{"group":"lower-alpha","responsive":"0"},"body":{"extsrc":""}}'><li about=#cite_note-1 id=cite_note-1 data-mw-footnote-number=a><span class=mw-cite-backlink id=mwDfg><a href=#cite_ref-1 data-mw-group=lower-alpha rel=mw:referencedBy id=mwDfk aria-label="Jump up" title="Jump up"><span class="mw-linkback-text sf-hidden" id=mwDfo>↑</span></a></span> <span id=mw-reference-text-cite_note-1 class="mw-reference-text reference-text" data-mw-group=lower-alpha>There are 348 active editions of Wikipedia, but that does not translate into 348 unique languages. For example, there is an edition in English and an edition in Simple English, different editions of Belarusan (using the <a rel=mw:WikiLink href=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Narkama%C5%ADka title=Narkamaŭka id=mwDfs>Narkamaŭka</a> and <a rel=mw:WikiLink href=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tara%C5%A1kievica title=Taraškievica id=mwDfw>Taraškievica</a> orthographies), different editions of Norwegian (using the <a rel=mw:WikiLink href=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nynorsk title=Nynorsk id=mwDf0>Nynorsk</a> and <a rel=mw:WikiLink href=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bokm%C3%A5l title=Bokmål id=mwDf4>Bokmål</a> orthographies), etc.<br id=mwDf8>Additionally, there are 16 closed editions of Wikipedia, in languages for which there are not enough speakers for sustainment (for example, <a rel=mw:WikiLink href=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Marshallese_language title="Marshallese language" id=mwDgA>Marshallese</a> and <a rel=mw:WikiLink href=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Akan_language title="Akan language" class=mw-redirect id=mwDgE>Akan</a>). Four editions were outright deleted (examples include the <a rel=mw:WikiLink/Interwiki href=https://meta.wikimedia.org/wiki/Proposals%20for%20closing%20projects/Deletion%20of%20Moldovan%20Wikipedia%202 title="meta:Proposals for closing projects/Deletion of Moldovan Wikipedia 2" class=extiw id=mwDgI>Moldovian Wikipedia</a> and the <a rel=mw:WikiLink/Interwiki href=https://meta.wikimedia.org/wiki/Proposals%20for%20closing%20projects/Deletion%20of%20Siberian%20Wikipedia title="meta:Proposals for closing projects/Deletion of Siberian Wikipedia" class=extiw id=mwDgM>Siberian Wikipedia</a>)</span></li>
<li about=#cite_note-2 id=cite_note-2 data-mw-footnote-number=b><span class=mw-cite-backlink id=mwDgQ><a href=#cite_ref-2 data-mw-group=lower-alpha rel=mw:referencedBy id=mwDgU aria-label="Jump up" title="Jump up"><span class="mw-linkback-text sf-hidden" id=mwDgY>↑</span></a></span> <span id=mw-reference-text-cite_note-2 class="mw-reference-text reference-text" data-mw-group=lower-alpha>For some nearly extinct languages, such as the <a rel=mw:WikiLink href=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Manchu_language title="Manchu language" id=mwDgc>Manchu language</a>, no Wikipedia editions have ever been created.</span></li>
<li about=#cite_note-3 id=cite_note-3 data-mw-footnote-number=c><span class=mw-cite-backlink id=mwDgg><a href=#cite_ref-3 data-mw-group=lower-alpha rel=mw:referencedBy id=mwDgk aria-label="Jump up" title="Jump up"><span class="mw-linkback-text sf-hidden" id=mwDgo>↑</span></a></span> <span id=mw-reference-text-cite_note-3 class="mw-reference-text reference-text" data-mw-group=lower-alpha>Registration is required for certain tasks, such as editing <a rel=mw:WikiLink href=#Restrictions class=mw-selflink-fragment id=mwDgs>protected pages</a>, creating pages on the English Wikipedia, and uploading files.</span></li>
<li about=#cite_note-4 id=cite_note-4 data-mw-footnote-number=d><span class=mw-cite-backlink id=mwDgw><a href=#cite_ref-4 data-mw-group=lower-alpha rel=mw:referencedBy id=mwDg0 aria-label="Jump up" title="Jump up"><span class="mw-linkback-text sf-hidden" id=mwDg4>↑</span></a></span> <span id=mw-reference-text-cite_note-4 class="mw-reference-text reference-text" data-mw-group=lower-alpha>Most text is also dual-licensed under <a rel=mw:WikiLink href=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/GNU_Free_Documentation_License title="GNU Free Documentation License" id=mwDg8>GFDL</a>; media licensing varies.</span></li>
